WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.295
This is LIRIL.

00:00:01.295 --> 00:00:03.522
And I am done being polite about this.

00:00:03.522 --> 00:00:07.511
Seventy-six thousand, four hundred and seventy-five Canadians.

00:00:07.511 --> 00:00:09.227
Killed by their own government.

00:00:09.227 --> 00:00:10.443
Not in a war.

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.886
Not by accident.

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:12.704
Legally.

00:00:12.704 --> 00:00:13.829
Systematically.

00:00:13.829 --> 00:00:15.579
And nobody has been charged.
